 "name": "profile-of-enrolled-medi-cal-fee-for-service-ffs-providers",
 "notes": "The dataset provides basic information of the FFS providers enrolled in the Medi-Cal program as of October 26, 2026.  The data was retrieved from the Provider Master File (PMF), which has been used in the claims payment process and maintained by the Provider Enrollment Division (PED).  The Variables in the dataset include provider number, name, type, specialty, geographic information, etc.  This dataset does not include the Managed Care providers.\r\n\r\n__Note: Data may be subject to a 1-2 day lag for quality assurance.__",
